Desert is the second zone in the [[Fight|Fight Screen]], featuring 30 unique enemies. Defeating Keymaster B at the end of the zone unlocks access to the next zone, [[Mountains]]. Clearing the Desert also unlocks the [[Perks#Gray Crusades Perk Tree|Gray Perk Tree]], [[Farming]], and the second row of [[Ascension]] perks.

Every monster in the Desert has a 1/300 chance to drop a unique [[Cards|Card]], and have +20% chance afterwards to drop higher quality star cards.

